purified human soluble cyclooxidative hydrolase by nickel ion chelation chromatography combined with and BTS (Benzylthio-Sepharose) affinity chromatography, and the target proteins showed a high purity, as determined by SDS-PAGE analysis.
Ge et al. (2022)
purified the recombinant SARS-CoV-2 S1 protein by immobilized metal affinity chromatography and used it as an antigen for immunizing hens.
